    <briefdescription>
<para>An animation transition that reveals the target data point by point from start to end. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Assign to <computeroutput><ref refid="classQAccelPlot_1_1LineCurve_1aeec8b6c794c1bba729633ca946965577" kindref="member">LineCurve::transition</ref></computeroutput> to draw the new curve in, or to <computeroutput><ref refid="classQAccelPlot_1_1BarSeries_1a6524e8d881ea6040fe4be3cd46cbb8f6" kindref="member">BarSeries::transition</ref></computeroutput> to show the new bars one after another.</para>
